    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]] creates one of the following effects at random (roll [[/r 1d4#Cataclysmic Event]]):</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>1: Clinging Flames.</strong> <em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=tUJIM74oC6JUcDJC]], each creature in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=tUJIM74oC6JUcDJC]]-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=tUJIM74oC6JUcDJC]] feet. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=tUJIM74oC6JUcDJC]] damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage. <em>Failure or Success:</em> The target starts &amp;Reference[burning].</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>2: Freezing Waves.</strong> <em>Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=rF7ttNDNWDfvxxkl]], each creature in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=rF7ttNDNWDfvxxkl]]-foot Cone. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=rF7ttNDNWDfvxxkl]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false] condition. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only. <em>Failure or Success:</em> The target’s Speed is reduced to 0 until the end of its next turn.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>3: Raging Storm.</strong> A storm cloud fills a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=RNZgZ52YOGGAg1zj]]-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=RNZgZ52YOGGAg1zj]] feet. The cloud lasts for 1 minute or until the [[lookup @name lowercase]] uses Cataclysmic Event again. Creatures entirely in the cloud have the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] and &amp;Reference[Deafened apply=false] conditions and can’t cast spells with a Verbal component. <em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=RNZgZ52YOGGAg1zj]], each creature that enters the cloud for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=RNZgZ52YOGGAg1zj]] damage. <em>Success:</em> Half damage.</p><p class=\"feature-trait\"><strong>4: Swallowing Earth.</strong> <em>Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=sJ4avTypqPGWDLlD]], each creature in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=sJ4avTypqPGWDLlD]]-foot Cube originating from a point on the ground within [[lookup @range.value activity=sJ4avTypqPGWDLlD]] feet. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average activity=sJ4avTypqPGWDLlD]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false] condition and is buried under rubble. A buried target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition, has &amp;Reference[Total Cover], and is &amp;Reference[suffocating]. As an action, a buried creature or another creature within 5 feet of it can make a [[/check ability=str skill=ath dc=@skills.ath.passive format=long]]. On a successful check, the creature is no longer buried. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
